Dragon Burst 0186: backport of the BL PC SDK commit cf75e40 (iExplosiveRage/rexglue-sdk)
"graphics: wider display aspect ratios (ultrawide) for games that render 16:9".
Needed by the BL v7.3 game code (burstlimit_widescreen.cpp). The D3D12 part does not build on Android;
the Vulkan side of the overlay placement is not done here (the projection part works).

